msgid "Where to go from here"
msgstr "接下來可以從哪裡開始"

msgid ""
"Now that we have the basics covered there are several options to look at for "
"your XR game dev journey:"
msgstr ""
"現在我們已經學會了基本內容，接下來在 XR 遊戲開發旅程中還有幾個方向可以探索："

msgid ""
"You can take a look at the :ref:`Advanced topics <openxr-advanced-topics>` "
"section."
msgstr "你可以參考 :ref:`進階主題 <openxr-advanced-topics>` 章節。"

msgid ""
"You can look at a number of `XR demos here <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot-demo-projects/tree/master/xr>`_."
msgstr ""
"你可以在 `這裡 <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/"
"master/xr>`_ 查看多個 XR 範例專案。"

msgid ""
"You can find 3rd party tutorials on our :ref:`Tutorials and resources "
"<doc_community_tutorials>` page."
msgstr ""
"你可以在我們的 :ref:`教學與資源 <doc_community_tutorials>` 頁面找到第三方教學"
"資源。"

msgid "Godot OpenXR vendor plugin"
msgstr "Godot OpenXR 廠商外掛"

msgid ""
"The vendor plugin isn't just for :ref:`deploying to Android "
"<doc_deploying_to_android>`. In the vendor plugin, we implement many OpenXR "
"vendor extensions that unlock unique features on certain devices, or "
"features that are new enough that a standardized implementation is not "
"available yet."
msgstr ""
"供應商外掛不僅僅只是 :ref:`deploying to Android "
"<doc_deploying_to_android>` 。在供應商外掛中，我們實作了很多 OpenXR 供應商拓"
"展，這對於解鎖某些特定裝置上的功能或者那些過於新穎而未被標準化實作的功能。"

msgid ""
"Together with the OpenXR working group we maintain a `client support matrix "
"<https://github.khronos.org/OpenXR-Inventory/"
"extension_support.html#client_matrix>`_ that lists all the OpenXR extensions "
"Godot supports and whether they require the vendor plugin."
msgstr ""
"我們與 OpenXR 團隊共同維護了一份 `用戶端支援矩陣 <https://github.khronos.org/"
"OpenXR-Inventory/extension_support.html#client_matrix>`_ ，在其中列出了所有"
"Godot所支援的 OpenXR 拓展以及是否他們需要供應商外掛。"

msgid "XR Toolkits"
msgstr "XR 工具包"

msgid ""
"There are various XR toolkits available that implement more complex XR logic "
"ready for you to use. We have a :Ref:`small introduction to Godot XR Tools "
"<doc_introducing_xr_tools>` that you can look at, a toolkit developed by "
"core contributors of Godot."
msgstr ""
"有許多現成的 XR 工具包實作了更複雜的 XR 邏輯，比如 :Ref:`small introduction "
"to Godot XR Tools <doc_introducing_xr_tools>` ，這是由 Godot 的核心貢獻者開發"
"的工具包。"

msgid "There are more toolkits available for Godot:"
msgstr "Godot 還有其他可用的 XR 工具包："

msgid ""
"`Godot XR handtracking toolkit <https://github.com/RevolNoom/"
"godot_xr_handtracking>`_ (GDScript)"
msgstr ""
"`Godot XR 手部追蹤工具包 <https://github.com/RevolNoom/"
"godot_xr_handtracking>`_ （GDScript）"

msgid ""
"`Godot XR Kit <https://github.com/patrykkalinowski/godot-xr-kit>`_ (GDScript)"
msgstr ""
"`Godot XR Kit <https://github.com/patrykkalinowski/godot-xr-kit>`_ "
"（GDScript）"

msgid ""
"`Godot XR Tools <https://github.com/godotvr/godot-xr-tools>`_ (GDScript)"
msgstr ""
"`Godot XR Tools <https://github.com/godotvr/godot-xr-tools>`_ （GDScript）"

msgid "`NXR <https://github.com/stumpynub/NXR>`_ (C#)"
msgstr "`NXR <https://github.com/stumpynub/NXR>`_ （C#）"
